  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Reckless Savage Demon Venerable’s recorded voice names Devouring Blue Leopard Transformation as the second of three immortal moves drawn from The Legends of Ren Zu stretch on pursuing freedom, and says that move uses mutation Gu as the core. He likens freedom itself to mutation Gu’s effect: it can make you better and can also make you worse.",
        "chapters": [
          1956
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_reckless_savage_demon_venerable",
          "move_devouring_blue_leopard_transformation",
          "sys_the_legends_of_ren_zu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Besides being an otherworldly demon with hope of destroying fate Gu, an inheritor must possess at least one of attitude Gu, mutation Gu, and adaptation Gu. Those three correspond to three killer moves that can trigger Reckless Savage’s killer moves above Embroidered Tower.",
        "chapters": [
          1956
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_fate_gu",
          "gu_attitude_gu",
          "gu_adaptation_gu",
          "house_embroidered_tower"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The final combination move incomplete freedom transformation has three cores: Attitude, Mutation, and Adaptation.",
        "chapters": [
          1956
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "incomplete-freedom-cores",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "evt_legend_attitude"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Feng Jiu Ge tells Fang Yuan that Heavenly Court’s Embroidered Tower holds three true inheritances left by Reckless Savage Demon Venerable, and that each requires a key: attitude Gu, mutation Gu, and adaptation Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          1963
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "embroidered-tower-keys",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_feng_jiu_ge",
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "fac_heavenly_court"
        ]
      }
    ]
